  "rawText": "Item Class: Maps\nRarity: Rare\nFoul Bearing\nBlighted Map (Tier 14)\n--------\nMap Area: Forbidden Woods\nItem Quantity: +58% (augmented)\nItem Rarity: +33% (augmented)\nMonster Pack Size: +22% (augmented)\n--------\nItem Level: 83\n--------\nMonster Level: 81\n--------\n{ Implicit Modifier }\nArea is infested with Fungal Growths\nMap's Item Quantity Modifiers also affect Blight Chest count at 25% value\nCan be Anointed up to 3 times — Unscalable Value\nNatives of the Area are Removed — Unscalable Value\n--------\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Unyielding\" (Tier: 1) — Physical, Chaos, Attack, Ailment }\nMonsters have a 50% chance to avoid Poison, Impale, and Bleeding\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Burning\" (Tier: 1) — Damage, Physical, Elemental, Fire }\nMonsters deal 100(90-110)% extra Physical Damage as Fire\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Overlord's\" (Tier: 1) — Attack, Caster, Speed }\nUnique Boss deals 25% increased Damage\nUnique Boss has 30% increased Attack and Cast Speed\n{ Suffix Modifier \"of Bleeding\" (Tier: 1) — Life, Mana, Defences, Energy Shield }\nPlayers cannot Regenerate Life, Mana or Energy Shield — Unscalable Value\n--------\nTravel to this Map by using it in a personal Map Device. Maps can only be used once.\n",
